---
// Warm Invitation and Call-to-Action Section Component
---

<section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-gold-gradient text-gospel-navy-950 relative overflow-hidden">
  
  <!-- Subtle Background Accents -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10 bg-[radial-gradient(#0D2040_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:20px_20px]"></div>

  <div class="relative max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center space-y-8">
    
    <!-- Heart & Tag -->
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-gospel-navy-950 text-gospel-gold-300 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest shadow-md">
      <span>Dios tiene un propósito para ti</span>
      <span class="text-rose-400">❤️</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Heading -->
    <h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black tracking-tight text-gospel-navy-950 leading-tight">
      ¡TE ESPERAMOS!<br />
      <span class="font-serif italic font-normal text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl block mt-2">
        Tu vida puede cambiar hoy.
      </span>
    </h2>

    <p class="text-lg sm:text-2xl text-gospel-navy-900 font-medium max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
      Ven con tu familia y amigos. En <strong>Gospel</strong> encontrarás una casa de puertas abiertas y un mensaje lleno de fe, salvación y esperanza.
    </p>

    <!-- Action Buttons -->
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 pt-4">
      
      <!-- WhatsApp CTA -->
      <a 
        href="https://wa.me/?text=Hola%2C%20quisiera%20m%C3%A1s%20informaci%C3%B3n%20sobre%20los%20servicios%20de%20la%20Iglesia%20Gospel." 
        target="_blank" 
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-gospel-navy-950 hover:bg-gospel-navy-900 text-white font-extrabold px-8 py-4 rounded-2xl text-base shadow-2xl transition-all active:scale-95"
      >
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 fill-emerald-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path d="M12.031 6.172c-3.181 0-5.767 2.586-5.768 5.766-.001 1.298.38 2.27 1.019 3.287l-.582 2.128 2.182-.573c.978.58 1.911.928 3.145.929 3.178 0 5.767-2.587 5.768-5.766.001-3.187-2.575-5.77-5.764-5.771zm3.392 8.244c-.144.405-.837.774-1.17.824-.299.045-.677.063-1.092-.069-.252-.08-.575-.187-.988-.365-1.739-.751-2.874-2.502-2.961-2.617-.087-.116-.708-.94-.708-1.793s.448-1.273.607-1.446c.159-.173.346-.217.462-.217l.332.006c.106.005.249-.04.39.299.144.347.491 1.2.534 1.287.043.087.072.188.014.304-.058.116-.087.188-.173.289l-.26.304c-.087.086-.177.18-.076.354.101.174.449.741.964 1.201.662.591 1.221.774 1.394.86s.275.058.376-.058c.101-.116.433-.506.549-.68.116-.173.231-.145.39-.087s1.011.477 1.184.564.289.13.332.202c.043.073.043.419-.101.824z"/>
        </svg>
        <span>Escríbenos por WhatsApp</span>
      </a>

      <!-- Horarios Direct Link -->
      <a 
        href="#horarios" 
        class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-white/90 hover:bg-white text-gospel-navy-950 font-bold px-8 py-4 rounded-2xl text-base shadow-md transition-all active:scale-95"
      >
        <span>Revisar Horarios</span>
      </a>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
